  "text": "Track 2.1 In the winter, this country is very cold and there is a lot of snow. There are high mountains and in winter they are beautiful. The snow is white and the sky is blue because it is very sunny. The forest is green all year. This is an island near the equator and the climate is hot all year. There are two seasons, rainy and dry. In the rainy season, it rains every day and there are a lot of black clouds. In the dry season, the sky is blue and it is very sunny. My country has four seasons. My favorite is spring because there are flowers everywhere and it is very green. In the summer, it is hot and dry. There are storms and autumn and it is rainy and windy but the trees are beautiful. The leaves are red, yellow and orange and the sky is blue. Winter is cold and there is snow. This country is hot all year and it rains about one week a year. It is very dry and sunny. In the summer, the temperature can reach 50 degrees centigrade. There is a big desert with a lot of sand but no trees. People live by the sea and there are big parks in the towns.",
